{%- comment -%}
  Product buy box. Follows Kapiva's module order: gallery, promise, description,
  quantity, call-to-order, delivery check, dual CTA, trust strip. Kapiva's pack
  ladder is deliberately absent — see the note above the CTA.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign p = product -%}
{%- assign v = p.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign product_category = p.type | default: p.vendor -%}
{%- assign product_name = p.metafields.helbrede.title.value | default: p.title -%}
{%- assign product_subtitle = p.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value | default: p.metafields.custom.subtitle.value | default: p.metafields.helbrede.subtitle.value -%}
{%- assign pack_size = p.metafields.custom.pack_size.value | default: p.metafields.helbrede.pack_size.value -%}

<nav class="wrap crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>
  {%- if product.collections.first -%}<a href="{{ product.collections.first.url }}">{{ product.collections.first.title }}</a><span>/</span>{%- endif -%}
  <span class="t-dim">{{ product_name }}</span>
</nav>

<section class="wrap pdp" data-product='{{ p.variants | json }}'>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- gallery ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pdp__media">
    <div class="pdp__stage">
      {%- if v.compare_at_price and v.compare_at_price > v.price -%}
        {%- assign pct = v.compare_at_price | minus: v.price | times: 100 | divided_by: v.compare_at_price | round -%}
        <span class="badge badge--save pdp__stage-flag">{{ pct }}% off</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for img in p.images limit: 8 -%}
        <img class="pdp__shot {% if forloop.first %}is-on{% endif %}"
             data-shot="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
             src="{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="{{ img.alt | escape }}"
             width="900" height="900"
             {% if forloop.first %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    {%- if p.images.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="pdp__thumbs" role="tablist" aria-label="Product images">
        {%- for img in p.images limit: 8 -%}
          <button class="pdp__thumb {% if forloop.first %}is-on{% endif %}" data-thumb="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                  role="tab" aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                  aria-label="View image {{ forloop.index }}">
            <img src="{{ img | image_url: width: 240 }}" alt="" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy">
          </button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- buy box ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pdp__buy">
    <p class="t-eyebrow">{{ product_category }}</p>
    <h1 class="pdp__title">{{ product_name }}</h1>
    {%- if product_subtitle != blank -%}<p class="pdp__sub">{{ product_subtitle }}</p>{%- endif -%}

    {%- if p.description != blank -%}
      <div class="pdp__desc" data-clamp>
        {{ p.description }}
      </div>
      <button class="pdp__more" data-clamp-toggle aria-expanded="false">Read more</button>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if p.metafields.helbrede.benefits.value.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="ticks pdp__ticks">
        {%- for b in p.metafields.helbrede.benefits.value limit: 4 -%}<li>{{ b }}</li>{%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if p.metafields.helbrede.usage_horizon.value != blank -%}
      <p class="pdp__horizon">{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf', size: 15 %}{{ p.metafields.helbrede.usage_horizon.value }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      No pack ladder. Every product is a single stocked bottle, so Pack of 2 /
      3 as variants would each get their own inventory item starting at zero —
      the ladder would render entirely sold out — and stocking them would count
      the same physical bottles two and three times over. Packs belong to a
      bundle app, which draws down the component stock. The markup is in git
      history if genuinely pre-packed SKUs ever exist.
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      A third of the catalogue is out of stock at any time. Offering an enabled
      "Add to cart" on those sent the shopper to a 422 and an empty cart drawer,
      so say it on the button instead — and skip the form entirely, since
      payment_button renders nothing for an unavailable variant anyway.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if v.available -%}
      {%- form 'product', p, class: 'pdp__form' -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          A real product form, purely so `payment_button` has something to
          filter: it is what draws Shop Pay, Google Pay and the rest. Add to
          cart stays type="button" and keeps going through the AJAX path, so
          the drawer behaviour is unchanged. The id and quantity inputs live
          inside the form because the wallet buttons submit it directly and
          would otherwise checkout the wrong variant at quantity 1.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" data-variant-input>

        {%- comment -%}
          The pack ladder sets QUANTITY, not variant. Every product is a single
          stocked bottle, so three bottles is quantity 3 of one SKU — inventory
          decrements correctly and no new SKU exists to run out separately. The
          saving is a Shopify automatic discount keyed on minimum quantity; the
          percentages here and there must agree, which is why they come from one
          pair of theme settings rather than being written into the markup.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if settings.pack_tiers_on -%}
          {%- assign keep2 = 100 | minus: settings.pack_tier2_pct -%}
          {%- assign keep3 = 100 | minus: settings.pack_tier3_pct -%}
          {%- assign total2 = v.price | times: 2 | times: keep2 | divided_by: 100 -%}
          {%- assign total3 = v.price | times: 3 | times: keep3 | divided_by: 100 -%}
          {%- assign each2 = total2 | divided_by: 2 -%}
          {%- assign each3 = total3 | divided_by: 3 -%}
          <div class="pdp__block">
            <h2 class="pdp__block-h">Choose your pack</h2>
            <div class="packs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose your pack">
              <button type="button" class="pack is-on" data-pack-qty="1" role="radio" aria-checked="true">
                <span class="pack__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="pack__mid">
                  <span class="pack__t">1 bottle</span>
                  <span class="pack__u">try it</span>
                </span>
                <span class="pack__right"><span class="pack__price">{{ v.price | money }}</span></span>
              </button>

              <button type="button" class="pack" data-pack-qty="2" role="radio" aria-checked="false">
                <span class="pack__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="pack__mid">
                  <span class="pack__t">2 bottles</span>
                  <span class="pack__u">{{ each2 | money }} each</span>
                </span>
                <span class="pack__right">
                  <span class="pack__price">{{ total2 | money }}</span>
                  <span class="pack__each">save {{ settings.pack_tier2_pct }}%</span>
                </span>
              </button>

              <button type="button" class="pack" data-pack-qty="3" role="radio" aria-checked="false">
                <span class="pack__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="pack__mid">
                  <span class="pack__t">3 bottles</span>
                  <span class="pack__u">{{ each3 | money }} each</span>
                </span>
                <span class="pack__right">
                  <span class="pack__price">{{ total3 | money }}</span>
                  <span class="pack__each">save {{ settings.pack_tier3_pct }}%</span>
                </span>
                <span class="badge badge--best pack__badge">Best value</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <p class="packs__note t-sm t-dim-3">Saving applied at checkout.</p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="pdp__actions">
          <div class="pdp__qty">
            <span class="t-mono">Qty</span>
            <span class="qty">
              <button type="button" data-qty-step="-1" aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button>
              <span data-qty-value>1</span>
              <button type="button" data-qty-step="1" aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button>
            </span>
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1" data-qty-input>
          </div>

          <div class="pdp__cta">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" data-add-to-cart data-variant-id="{{ v.id }}">Add to cart</button>
            {{ form | payment_button }}
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} Populated by Cart.add when Shopify refuses the line. {%- endcomment -%}
          <p class="pdp__cart-error" data-cart-error role="alert" hidden></p>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="pdp__actions">
        <div class="pdp__cta">
          <button class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" disabled aria-disabled="true">Sold out</button>
          {%- assign in_stock_url = '/collections/all' -%}
          {%- assign p_concern = p.metafields.helbrede.concern.value -%}
          {%- if p_concern != blank and collections[p_concern].handle != blank -%}
            {%- assign in_stock_url = collections[p_concern].url -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ in_stock_url }}">See what is in stock</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <p class="pdp__tax t-sm t-dim-3">MRP inclusive of all taxes.{% if pack_size != blank %} {{ pack_size }} per unit.{% endif %}</p>

    {%- comment -%} ---------- delivery check ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="pdp__pin" data-pincode>
      <div class="pdp__pin-row">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'truck', size: 18 %}
        <label class="sr" for="pin">Delivery pincode</label>
        <input id="pin" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="Enter pincode" data-pin-input>
        <button class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" type="button" data-pin-check>Check</button>
      </div>
      <p class="pdp__pin-out" data-pin-out hidden></p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ---------- call to order ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <a class="pdp__call" href="tel:{{ settings.phone | replace: ' ', '' }}">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 18 %}
      <span>
        <b>Difficulty ordering online? Call to order</b>
        <small>{{ settings.phone }} · {{ settings.call_hours }}</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    {%- comment -%} ---------- trust ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="pdp__trust">
      <span class="trust__item">{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf', size: 17 %} Formulated by Ayurvedic experts</span>
      <span class="trust__item">{% render 'icon', name: 'flask', size: 17 %} Every dose on the label</span>
      <span class="trust__item">{% render 'icon', name: 'shield', size: 17 %} GMP-certified facility</span>
      <span class="trust__item">{% render 'icon', name: 'truck', size: 17 %} Free delivery over {{ settings.free_ship_threshold | money }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Product buy box", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
